docs {
Panel admin: SEMUA search miss (termasuk yang sudah terjawab -
is_fulfilled true) + filter direction/fulfilled/visible + cursor
pagination Section 13. Admin & root saja. Item punya is_visible (14-api).

pending_contribution_count / pending_contribution_id: usulan kata baru
yang menaut miss ini (contributions.search_miss_id) dan masih menunggu
review. >0 = verifikator cek antrean dulu, jangan buat kata dobel.
pending_contribution_id = usulan pending tertua (deep link antrean).

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "01JDMiss0000000000000000000",
          "term": "kalintiak dua",
          "direction": "lemma",
          "hit_count": 2,
          "last_searched_at": "2026-09-16T10:05:00.000Z",
          "is_fulfilled": false,
          "pending_contribution_count": 1,
          "pending_contribution_id": "01JDContribution000000000001",
          "is_visible": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-16T10:00:00.000Z"
        }
      ],
      "meta": { "limit": 20, "next_cursor": null, "has_more": false }
    }
}

meta {
  name: Admin List Search Misses
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/search-misses?limit=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

tests {
  test("200 + daftar miss dengan status terjawab", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.data).to.be.an('array');
    expect(res.body.data[0]).to.have.property('is_fulfilled');
    expect(res.body.data[0]).to.have.property('pending_contribution_count');
    expect(res.body.meta).to.have.property('has_more');
  });
}
